{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgksci57EHZLSXTCyWh1D","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'd sign up. My part is 750 ₪ a month, the employer puts in 2,250 ₪, and the chart said I'd have about 136,457 ₪ in my hands after 5 years. I'm fairly sure, but that \"‎−64,761 ₪\" for tax scared me.\n\n**How it went.** At the top it said \"קרן השתלמות\", so I knew it was the right page. I scrolled down to the boxes where my salary was already in: \"משכורת ברוטו בחודש 30,000\". Next to it were 2.5% for me, 7.5% for the employer, return 7%, fee 0.54%. I didn't touch any of them.\n\n**The chart.** The first big number I saw was \"45,000 ₪ הפקדתם\", what I put in. Then \"+135,000 ₪\" from the employer and \"+21,218 ₪\" in returns. Then a red one, \"‎−64,761 ₪ המס\", and at the end \"136,457 ₪ נשאר בידיים\". The one thing that decided it for me: the employer puts in three times what I do. The line above said \"750 ₪ בחודש מכם, 2,250 ₪ מהמעסיק\".\n\n**The tax.** The chart was set to \"5 שנים\", and that part was labelled \"לפני 6 שנים: מס\". I didn't drag it to 6 years to see what happens without the tax. Later, in \"כסף נכנס ויוצא\", I saw \"כשעוברות 6 שנים\", so the money is free after 6 years. My guess is that 6 years is when there's no tax, but I didn't check it on the chart.\n\n**What I skipped.** I didn't read the grey notes under the chart. I scrolled past \"שווה לדעת\", \"מי מציע ומי מפקח\" and \"כמה זה עולה\". I only caught \"עד 2% בשנה\" there, and it went straight past me. I stopped before the end of \"מיסוי\" and didn't open screens 4 and 5.\n\n**Words I didn't get:**\n- \"תקרה\"\n- \"מנכה 47% מס\"\n- \"הצגת החברות\"\n- the \"‎15,712 ₪\" in \"ורק על שכר של עד 15,712 ₪\". I make 30,000, so I don't know if the 7.5% is even on my whole salary.\n\n**What bothered me:**\n- It's not clear if 136,457 is after the tax or if the tax still comes off it.\n- It doesn't say which company I'm actually with.\n- The page is long and full of \"חוקים וכללים\" tags. I'd have closed it around \"כמה זה עולה\"."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3859,"cache_read_input_tokens":11377,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3859},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"197eb82b-018d-4fd3-a562-9f2fc94fb45d","uuid":"6d01b708-6e4a-42aa-8453-0bd59d363d51","timestamp":"2026-11-06T02:19:21.436Z","request_id":"req_011CgkschrhZkDpjZ6innt1S"}
